Title: Example
Shortname: example
Abstract: A small spec in Bikeshed's format, for the bikeshed tokenizer (see
    tools/src/tree_sitter_support/spec_tokenizer.rs).
</pre>

Introduction {#intro}
=====================

A <dfn>widget</dfn> has a <dfn for=widget>state</dfn>, which [[HTML]] doesn't define.

# Widgets # {#widgets}

To <dfn>poke</dfn> a [=widget=] |widget|, run these steps:

1. Set |widget|'s [=widget/state=] to "poked".
1. Return.

<div algorithm>
To <dfn>unpoke</dfn> a [=widget=] |widget|:

1. Set |widget|'s [=widget/state|state=] to "idle".
</div>

## Gadgets ## {#gadgets}

<pre class=idl>
[Exposed=Window]
interface Gadget {
  undefined poke();
};
</pre>

The {{Gadget/poke()}} method steps are to [=poke=] <{img}> elements.
